{"user_id":1,"name":"季度复盘模板","description":"对季度目标达成、问题与改进进行结构化复盘","structure":"# ${period} 季度复盘\n\n## 一、目标达成\n${achievements}\n\n## 二、问题与差距\n${problems}\n\n## 三、根因分析\n${root_causes}\n\n## 四、下季度改进\n${improvements}\n\n## 五、整体评分\n${score}/10","variables":[{"key":"period","label":"季度","type":"text","required":true,"placeholder":"如：2026 Q3","options":[]},{"key":"achievements","label":"目标达成","type":"textarea","required":true,"placeholder":"对照目标逐项说明完成度与数据","options":[]},{"key":"problems","label":"问题与差距","type":"textarea","required":true,"placeholder":"列出未达成项及偏差","options":[]},{"key":"root_causes","label":"根因分析","type":"textarea","required":false,"placeholder":"分析问题背后的主要原因","options":[]},{"key":"improvements","label":"下季度改进","type":"textarea","required":true,"placeholder":"针对根因给出可执行改进措施","options":[]},{"key":"score","label":"整体评分","type":"number","required":true,"placeholder":"1-10","options":[]}],"prompt":"复盘要客观、有数据支撑：达成项讲方法，未达项讲根因与对策；改进措施具体可执行，避免泛泛而谈。","status":"enabled","create_time":1791216000000,"update_time":1791216000000}
